="00:33.000" end="00:33.390">if </span><span begin="00:33.390" end="00:33.540">I </span><span begin="00:33.540" end="00:34.140">sing </span><span begin="00:34.140" end="00:36.270">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.330" end="00:38.490"><span begin="00:36.330" end="00:36.450">A </span><span begin="00:36.450" end="00:36.930">little </span><span begin="00:36.930" end="00:37.030">*</span><span begin="00:37.030" end="00:37.130">*</span><span begin="00:37.130" end="00:37.230">*</span><span begin="00:37.230" end="00:37.330">*</span><span begin="00:37.330" end="00:37.430">*</span><span begin="00:37.430" end="00:37.530">*</span><span begin="00:37.530" end="00:37.650">* </span><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:38.490">louder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.490" end="00:41.970"><span begin="00:38.490" end="00:39.000">To </span><span begin="00:39.000" end="00:39.180">a </span><span begin="00:39.180" end="00:39.900">happy </span><span begin="00:39.900" end="00:41.970">song</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.360" end="00:44.490"><span begin="00:42.360" end="00:42.720">I'll </span><span begin="00:42.720" end="00:43.020">be </span><span begin="00:43.020" end="00:44.490">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.700" end="00:48.420"><span begin="00:44.700" end="00:46.080">You </span><span begin="00:46.080" end="00:46.530">want </span><span begin="00:46.530" end="00:46.830">to </span><span begin="00:46.830" end="00:47.310">give </span><span begin="00:47.310" end="00:48.420">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.230" end="00:52.080"><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.830">Gave </span><span begin="00:49.830" end="00:50.160">it </span><span begin="00:50.160" end="00:50.790">all </span><span begin="00:50.790" end="00:51.150">that </span><span begin="00:51.150" end="00:51.420">you've </span><span begin="00:51.420" end="00:52.080">got</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.140" end="00:54.900"><span begin="00:52.140" end="00:52.680">And </span><span begin="00:52.680" end="00:52.740">it </span><span begin="00:52.740" end="00:53.550">still </span><span begin="00:53.550" end="00:54.180">doesn't </span><span begin="00:54.180" end="00:54.900">cut</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.930" end="00:58.590"><span begin="00:54.930" end="00:55.410">But </span><span begin="00:55.410" end="00:55.680">if </span><span begin="00:55.680" end="00:55.860">you </span><span begin="00:55.860" end="00:56.460">sing </span><span begin="00:56.460" end="00:58.590">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.650" end="01:00.810"><span begin="00:58.650" end="00:58.800">A </span><span begin="00:58.800" end="00:59.250">little </span><span begin="00:59.250" end="00:59.350">*</span><span begin="00:59.350" end="00:59.450">*</span><span begin="00:59.450" end="00:59.550">*</span><span begin="00:59.550" end="00:59.650">*</span><span begin="00:59.650" end="00:59.750">*</span><span begin="00:59.750" end="00:59.850">*</span><span begin="00:59.850" end="00:59.970">* </span><span begin="00:59.970" end="01:00.810">louder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.810" end="01:04.650"><span begin="01:00.810" end="01:01.320">To </span><span begin="01:01.320" end="01:01.530">a </span><span begin="01:01.530" end="01:02.220">happy </span><span begin="01:02.220" end="01:04.650">song</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.680" end="01:07.170"><span begin="01:04.680" end="01:05.070">You'll </span><span begin="01:05.070" end="01:05.370">be </span><span begin="01:05.370" end="01:05.760">just </span><span begin="01:05.760" end="01:06.570">fine </span><span begin="01:06.570" end="01:07.170">cos'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.170" end="01:11.760"><span begin="01:07.170" end="01:07.500">Every </span><span begin="01:07.500" end="01:08.070">now </span><span begin="01:08.070" end="01:08.160">and </span><span begin="01:08.160" end="01:08.760">again </span><span begin="01:08.760" end="01:09.000">we </span><span begin="01:09.000" end="01:09.420">get </spa