01:26.700" end="01:27.240">going </span><span begin="01:27.240" end="01:27.690">round </span><span begin="01:27.690" end="01:27.810">in </span><span begin="01:27.810" end="01:29.070">circles</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.070" end="01:35.970"><span begin="01:29.070" end="01:29.190">S</span><span begin="01:29.190" end="01:29.190">.</span><span begin="01:29.190" end="01:29.250">P</span><span begin="01:29.250" end="01:35.130">.</span><span begin="01:35.130" end="01:35.730">I</span><span begin="01:35.730" end="01:35.730">.</span><span begin="01:35.730" end="01:35.790">R</span><span begin="01:35.790" end="01:35.790">.</span><span begin="01:35.790" end="01:35.820">I</span><span begin="01:35.820" end="01:35.820">.</span><span begin="01:35.820" end="01:35.970">T</span><span begin="01:35.970" end="01:35.970">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.970" end="01:41.790"><span begin="01:35.970" end="01:37.134">Spirit</span><span begin="01:37.134" end="01:38.298">, </span><span begin="01:38.298" end="01:39.462">let's </span><span begin="01:39.462" end="01:40.626">hear </span><span begin="01:40.626" end="01:41.790">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.790" end="01:43.020"><span begin="01:41.790" end="01:41.850">S</span><span begin="01:41.850" end="01:41.850">.</span><span begin="01:41.850" end="01:41.910">P</span><span begin="01:41.910" end="01:42.270">.</span><span begin="01:42.270" end="01:42.570">I</span><span begin="01:42.570" end="01:42.570">.</span><span begin="01:42.570" end="01:42.690">R</span><span begin="01:42.690" end="01:42.690">.</span><span begin="01:42.690" end="01:42.720">I</span><span begin="01:42.720" end="01:42.720">.</span><span begin="01:42.720" end="01:43.020">T</span><span begin="01:43.020" end="01:43.020">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.020" end="01:44.220"><span begin="01:43.020" end="01:43.260">Spirit</span><span begin="01:43.260" end="01:43.500">, </span><span begin="01:43.500" end="01:43.740">let's </span><span begin="01:43.740" end="01:43.980">hear </span><span begin="01:43.980" end="01:44.220">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.220" end="01:45.030"><span begin="01:44.220" end="01:44.490">We </span><span begin="01:44.490" end="01:44.760">are </span><span begin="01:44.760" end="01:45.030">possessed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.060" end="01:48.270"><span begin="01:45.060" end="01:45.630">We're </span><span begin="01:45.630" end="01:45.720">all </span><span begin="01:45.720" end="01:45.870">*</span><span begin="01:45.870" end="01:46.020">*</span><span begin="01:46.020" end="01:46.170">*</span><span begin="01:46.170" end="01:46.320">*</span><span begin="01:46.320" end="01:46.470">*</span><span begin="01:46.470" end="01:46.620">* </span><span begin="01:46.620" end="01:47.010">in </span><span begin="01:47.010" end="01:47.130">the </span><span begin="01:47.130" end="01:48.270">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.360" end="01:50.640"><span begin="01:48.360" end="01:49.470">Alone </span><span begin="01:49.470" end="01:49.740">and </span><span begin="01:49.740" end="01:50.640">depressed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.760" end="01:54.420"><span begin="01:50.760" end="01:51.150">But </span><span begin="01:51.150" end="01:51.480">if </span><span begin="01:51.480" end="01:51.720">we </span><span begin="01:51.720" end="01:52.290">sing </span><span begin="01:52.290" end="01:54.420">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.480" end="01:56.610"><span begin="01:54.480" end="01:54.600">A </span><span begin="01:54.600" end="01:55.080">little </span><span begin="01:55.080" end="01:55.170">*</span><span begin="01:55.170" end="01:55.260">*</span><span begin="01:55.260" end="01:55.350">*</span><span begin="01:55.350" end="01:55.440">*</span><span begin="01:55.440" end="01:55.530">*</span><span begin="01:55.530" end="01:55.620">*</span><span begin="01:55.620" end="01:55.770">* </span><span begin="01:55.770" end="01:56.610">louder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" beg